nommée dans votre code","hi":"कोई LED_BUILTIN नहीं: पिन का नाम आपके कोड में रखा जाता है","zh":"没有 LED_BUILTIN：引脚要在你的代码里命名"}},{"icon":"play","text":{"de":"EN startet den Sketch neu, genau wie auf dem echten Board","en":"EN restarts the sketch, just like the real board","es":"EN reinicia el sketch, igual que en la placa real","fr":"EN relance le sketch, comme sur la vraie carte","hi":"EN स्केच को फिर से शुरू करता है, बिल्कुल असली बोर्ड की तरह","zh":"EN 会重启程序，和真板子一样"}}],"hints":[{"de":"LED_BUILTIN gibt es auf diesem Board nicht. Benenne den Pin selbst: const int LED_PIN = 23;","en":"LED_BUILTIN does not exist on this board. Name the pin yourself: const int LED_PIN = 23;","es":"LED_BUILTIN no existe en esta placa. Pon tú el nombre al pin: const int LED_PIN = 23;","fr":"LED_BUILTIN n'existe pas sur cette carte. Nommez la broche vous-même : const int LED_PIN = 23;","hi":"इस बोर्ड पर LED_BUILTIN मौजूद नहीं है। पिन का नाम खुद रखें: const int LED_PIN = 23;","zh":"这块板上没有 LED_BUILTIN。自己给引脚起名：const int LED_PIN = 23;"},{"de":"Bleibt die LED dunkel, dreh sie um: Strom fließt nur vom langen zum kurzen Bein.","en":"If the LED stays dark, turn it round: current only flows from the long leg to the short one.","es":"Si el LED sigue apagado, dale la vuelta: la corriente solo va de la pata larga a la corta.","fr":"Si la LED reste éteinte, retournez-la : le courant ne passe que de la patte longue vers la courte.","hi":"अगर LED बुझी रहे, तो उसे घुमा दें: करंट सिर्फ़ लंबी टाँग से छोटी टाँग की ओर बहता है।","zh":"如果 LED 一直不亮，把它掉个头：电流只能从长脚流向短脚。"}],"kind":"lesson","lede":{"de":"Das DevKitC hat keine LED, die du programmieren kannst, also ist die erste Aufgabe, eine anzuschließen: GPIO23, ein 220-Ω-Widerstand, eine rote LED und zurück nach GND.","en":"The DevKitC has no LED you can program, so the first job is wiring one: GPIO23, a 220 Ω resistor, a red LED and back to GND.","es":"La DevKitC no tiene ningún LED que puedas programar, así que lo primero es conectar uno: GPIO23, una resistencia de 220 Ω, un LED rojo y de vuelta a GND.","fr":"La DevKitC n'a pas de LED programmable : la première tâche est donc d'en câbler une. GPIO23, une résistance de 220 Ω, une LED rouge et retour à GND.","hi":"DevKitC पर प्रोग्राम करने लायक कोई LED नहीं है, इसलिए पहला काम एक LED जोड़ना है: GPIO23, एक 220 Ω रेज़िस्टर, एक लाल LED और वापस GND।","zh":"DevKitC 上没有可以编程的 LED，所以第一件事就是自己接一颗：GPIO23、一个 220 Ω 电阻、一颗红色 LED，再回到 GND。"},"legacyFigure":{"circuit":"blink","page":"/figures/boards/esp32-devkitc.html","sheets":["board","breadboard","schematic","power"]},"level":"io","order":1,"pins":[{"color":"orange","pin":"GPIO23","role":{"de":"Ausgang, der die LED schaltet","en":"Output that switches the LED","es":"Salida que enciende y apaga el LED","fr":"Sortie qui commute la LED","hi":"LED को स्विच करने वाला आउटपुट","zh":"开关 LED 的输出"},"to":{"de":"220-Ω-Widerstand, dann die Anode der LED","en":"220 Ω resistor, then the LED's anode","es":"Resistencia de 220 Ω y luego el ánodo del LED","fr":"Résistance de 220 Ω, puis anode de la LED","hi":"220 Ω रेज़िस्टर, फिर LED का एनोड","zh":"220 Ω 电阻，再到 LED 的阳极"}},{"color":"black","pin":"GND","role":{"de":"Rückweg","en":"Return path","es":"Camino de vuelta","fr":"Chemin de retour","hi":"वापसी का रास्ता","zh":"回路"},"to":{"de":"Kathode der LED","en":"LED cathode","es":"Cátodo del LED","fr":"Cathode de la LED","hi":"LED का कैथोड","zh":"LED 阴极"}}],"quizzes":[{"id":"blink-quiz","questions":[{"answer":1,"id":"q1","options":[{"de":"GPIO2 kann keinen Ausgang treiben","en":"GPIO2 cannot drive an output","es":"GPIO2 no puede funcionar como salida","fr":"GPIO2 ne peut pas piloter une sortie","hi":"GPIO2 आउटपुट नहीं चला सकता","zh":"GPIO2 不能驱动输出"},{"de":"GPIO2 ist ein Strapping-Pin, der LOW oder offen sein muss, damit der Download-Modus startet","en":"GPIO2 is a strapping pin that must be low or floating to enter download mode","es":"GPIO2 es un pin de arranque que tiene que estar a nivel bajo o al aire para entrar en el modo de descarga","fr":"GPIO2 est une broche de strapping qui doit être à l'état bas ou flottante pour entrer en mode téléchargement","hi":"GPIO2 एक स्ट्रैपिंग पिन है, जिसे डाउनलोड मोड में जाने के लिए LOW या खुला होना चाहिए","zh":"GPIO2 是启动配置引脚，要进入下载模式它必须为低或悬空"},{"de":"GPIO23 ist der einzige Pin mit PWM","en":"GPIO23 is the only pin with PWM","es":"GPIO23 es el único pin con PWM","fr":"GPIO23 est la seule broche avec du PWM","hi":"सिर्फ़ GPIO23 में PWM है","zh":"GPIO23 是唯一有 PWM 的引脚"}],"q":{"de":"Warum nutzt diese Lektion GPIO23 und nicht GPIO2, den LED-Pin vieler Nachbau-Boards?","en":"Why does this lesson use GPIO23 and not GPIO2, the LED pin on many clone boards?","es":"¿Por qué esta lección usa GPIO23 y no GPIO2, el pin del LED en muchas placas clónicas?","fr":"Pourquoi cette leçon utilise-t-elle GPIO23 et pas GPIO2, la broche de la LED sur beaucoup de cartes clones ?","hi":"यह पाठ GPIO2 के बजाय GPIO23 क्यों इस्तेमाल करता है, जबकि कई क्लोन बोर्ड पर LED, GPIO2 पर होती है?","zh":"为什么这节课用 GPIO23，而不用 GPIO2（很多兼容板上的 LED 引脚）？"},"why":{"de":"GPIO2 wird beim Reset gelesen. Eine LED nach GND ist dort harmlos, aber ein Pull-up oder ein Taster kann Uploads verhindern, also ist ein einfacher Ausgang wie GPIO23 die sichere Gewohnheit.","en":"GPIO2 is read at reset. An LED to GND is harmless there, but a pull-up or button can stop uploads, so a plain output like GPIO23 is the safe habit.","es":"GPIO2 se lee en el reinicio. Un LED a GND ahí no molesta, pero una pull-up o un botón pueden impedir las cargas, así que una salida normal como GPIO23 es la costumbre segura.","fr":"GPIO2 est lue au reset. Une LED vers GND y est sans danger, mais un pull-up ou un bouton peut bloquer les téléversements : une simple sortie comme GPIO23 est donc la bonne habitude.","hi":"GPIO2 रीसेट पर पढ़ा जाता है। वहाँ GND तक LED से कोई नुकसान नहीं, पर पुल-अप या बटन अपलोड रोक सकता है, इसलिए GPIO23 जैसा सादा आउटपुट सुरक्षित आदत है।","zh":"复位时会读取 GPIO2。在那里接一颗 LED 到 GND 没有影响，但上拉电阻或按钮可能会挡住上传，所以用 GPIO23 这样的普通输出是稳妥的习惯。"}},{"answer":0,"id":"q2","options":[{"de":"Etwa 6 mA","en":"About 6 mA","es":"Unos 6 mA","fr":"Environ 6 mA","hi":"लगभग 6 mA","zh":"约 6 mA"},{"de":"Etwa 14 mA","en":"About 14 mA","es":"Unos 14 mA","fr":"Environ 14 mA","hi":"लगभग 14 mA","zh":"约 14 mA"},{"de":"Etwa 40 mA","en":"About 40 mA","es":"Unos 40 mA","fr":"Environ 40 mA","hi":"लगभग 40 mA","zh":"约 40 mA"}],"q":{"de":"Wie viel Strom zieht die LED mit 220 Ω an einem 3,3-V-Pin ungefähr?","en":"About how much current does the LED draw with 220 Ω from a 3.3 V pin?","es":"¿Cuánta corriente consume más o menos el LED con 220 Ω desde un pin de 3,3 V?","fr":"Environ combien de courant la LED tire-t-elle avec 220 Ω sur une broche 3,3 V ?","hi":"3.3 V पिन से 220 Ω के साथ LED लगभग कितना करंट लेती है?","zh":"从 3.3 V 引脚经过 220 Ω，LED 大约吃多少电流？"},"why":{"de":"(3,3 − 2,0) ÷ 220 sind etwa 5,9 mA. Der Wert von 14 mA gehört zu einem 5-V-Arduino.","en":"(3.3 − 2.0) ÷ 220 is about 5.9 mA. The 14 mA figure belongs to a 5 V Arduino.","es":"(3,3 − 2,0) ÷ 220 son unos 5,9 mA. Los 14 mA son lo que da un Arduino de 5 V.","fr":"(3,3 − 2,0) ÷ 220 font environ 5,9 mA. Le chiffre de 14 mA est celui d'un Arduino 5 V.","hi":"(3.3 − 2.0) ÷ 220 लगभग 5.9 mA है। 14 mA वाला आँकड़ा 5 V वाले Arduino का है।","zh":"(3.3 − 2.0) ÷ 220 约为 5.9 mA。14 mA 是 5 V Arduino 上的数字。"}},{"answer":2,"id":"q3","options":[{"de":"Stattdessen blinkt die rote LED","en":"The red LED blinks instead","es":"Parpadea el LED rojo","fr":"La LED rouge clignote à la place","hi":"उसकी जगह लाल LED ब्लिंक करती है","zh":"红色 LED 改为闪烁"},{"de":"Eine LED an GPIO2 blinkt","en":"An LED on GPIO2 blinks","es":"Parpadea un LED en GPIO2","fr":"Une LED sur GPIO2 clignote","hi":"GPIO2 पर एक LED ब्लिंक करती है","zh":"GPIO2 上的 LED 闪烁"},{"de":"Er lässt sich nicht kompilieren","en":"It doesn't compile","es":"No compila","fr":"Il ne compile pas","hi":"वह कंपाइल नहीं होता","zh":"编译不通过"}],"q":{"de":"Du fügst einen Blink-Sketch für den Uno ein, der LED_BUILTIN nutzt. Was passiert auf dem DevKitC?","en":"You paste an Uno blink sketch that uses LED_BUILTIN. What happens on the DevKitC?","es":"Pegas un sketch de parpadeo de la Uno que usa LED_BUILTIN. ¿Qué pasa en la DevKitC?","fr":"Vous collez un sketch de clignotement pour Uno qui utilise LED_BUILTIN. Que se passe-t-il sur la DevKitC ?","hi":"आप Uno का एक ब्लिंक स्केच चिपकाते हैं जो LED_BUILTIN इस्तेमाल करता है। DevKitC पर क्या होता है?","zh":"你粘贴了一个用 LED_BUILTIN 的 Uno 闪烁程序。在 DevKitC 上会怎样？"},"why":{"de":"Das DevKitC hat keine LED, die dein Code steuern kann, deshalb ist LED_BUILTIN dafür nicht definiert, und die rote LED zeigt nur, dass 5 V anliegen. Benenn den Pin, den du verdrahtet hast: const int LED_PIN = 23;","en":"The DevKitC has no LED your code can drive, so LED_BUILTIN isn't defined for it, and the red LED only shows that 5 V is there. Name the pin you wired: const int LED_PIN = 23;","es":"La DevKitC no tiene ningún LED que tu código pueda controlar, así que LED_BUILTIN no está definido para ella, y el LED rojo solo indica que hay 5 V. Ponle nombre al pin que has cableado: const int LED_PIN = 23;","fr":"La DevKitC n'a aucune LED que votre code puisse piloter : LED_BUILTIN n'y est donc pas défini, et la LED rouge indique seulement que le 5 V est présent. Nommez la broche que vous avez câblée : const int LED_PIN = 23;","hi":"DevKitC पर ऐसी कोई LED नहीं है जिसे आपका कोड चला सके, इसलिए उसके लिए LED_BUILTIN परिभाषित नहीं है, और लाल LED बस बताती है कि 5 V मौजूद है। जिस पिन पर आपने तार जोड़ा है, उसका नाम खुद रखें: const int LED_PIN = 23;","zh":"DevKitC 上没有代码能驱动的 LED，所以没有为它定义 LED_BUILTIN，而那颗红色 LED 只表示有 5 V。给你接线的引脚起个名字：const int LED_PIN = 23;"}}]}],"serialSample":{"baud":115200,"lines":["Blink on GPIO23"]},"specs":[{"label":{"de":"LED-Strom","en":"LED current","es":"Corriente del LED","fr":"Courant de la LED","hi":"LED करंट","zh":"LED 电流"},"value":{"de":"(3,3 V − 2,0 V) ÷ 220 Ω ≈ 5,9 mA","en":"(3.3 V − 2.0 V) ÷ 220 Ω ≈ 5.9 mA","es":"(3,3 V − 2,0 V) ÷ 220 Ω ≈ 5,9 mA","fr":"(3,3 V − 2,0 V) ÷ 220 Ω ≈ 5,9 mA","hi":"(3.3 V − 2.0 V) ÷ 220 Ω ≈ 5.9 mA","zh":"(3.3 V − 2.0 V) ÷ 220 Ω ≈ 5.9 mA"}},{"label":{"de":"Treiberstärke des Pins","en":"Pin drive","es":"Salida del pin","fr":"Courant d'une broche","hi":"पिन की ड्राइव","zh":"引脚驱动"},"value":{"de":"standardmäßig etwa 20 mA, höchstens 40 mA","en":"about 20 mA by default, 40 mA at most","es":"unos 20 mA por defecto, 40 mA como mucho","fr":"environ 20 mA par défaut, 40 mA au plus","hi":"डिफ़ॉल्ट रूप से लगभग 20 mA, ज़्यादा से ज़्यादा 40 mA","zh":"默认约 20 mA，最多 40 mA"}},{"label":{"de":"Logikpegel","en":"Logic level","es":"Nivel lógico","fr":"Niveau logique","hi":"लॉजिक स्तर","zh":"逻辑电平"},"value":{"de":"3,3 V; ein Eingang liest ab etwa 2,5 V HIGH","en":"3.3 V; an input reads HIGH from about 2.5 V","es":"3,3 V; una entrada lee HIGH a partir de unos 2,5 V","fr":"3,3 V ; une entrée lit HIGH à partir d'environ 2,5 V","hi":"3.3 V; इनपुट लगभग 2.5 V से HIGH पढ़ता है","zh":"3.3 V；输入从约 2.5 V 起读成 HIGH"}}],"starter":{"source":"src_sketch","template":"// The DevKitC has no user LED: wire one to GPIO23\nconst int LED_PIN = 23;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  Serial.begin(115200);\n  pinMode(LED_PIN, OUTPUT);\n  Serial.println(\"Blink on GPIO23\");\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  digitalWrite(LED_PIN, HIGH);\n  delay({{p:on}});\n  digitalWrite(LED_PIN, LOW);\n  delay({{p:off}});\n}\n"},"steps":[{"de":"Verbinde GPIO23 mit dem Widerstand, den Widerstand mit dem langen Bein der LED (Anode) und das kurze Bein (Kathode) mit GND.","en":"Wire GPIO23 to the resistor, the resistor to the LED's long leg (anode), and the short leg (cathode) to GND.","es":"Conecta GPIO23 a la resistencia, la resistencia a la pata larga del LED (ánodo) y la pata corta (cátodo) a GND.","fr":"Reliez GPIO23 à la résistance, la résistance à la patte longue de la LED (anode), et la patte courte (cathode) à GND.","hi":"GPIO23 को रेज़िस्टर से, रेज़िस्टर को LED की लंबी टाँग (एनोड) से, और छोटी टाँग (कैथोड) को GND से जोड़ें।","zh":"把 GPIO23 接到电阻，电阻接到 LED 的长脚（阳极），短脚（阴极）接 GND。"},{"de":"Stell die An- und Aus-Zeiten mit den Chips im Code ein.","en":"Set the on and off times with the chips in the code.","es":"Fija los tiempos de encendido y apagado con los botones del código.","fr":"Réglez les durées d'allumage et d'extinction avec les pastilles du code.","hi":"कोड में चिप से जलने और बुझने का समय सेट करें।","zh":"用代码里的选项设置亮灯和灭灯时长。"},{"de":"Führ den Sketch aus und beobachte die LED und den seriellen Monitor bei 115200 Baud.","en":"Run the sketch and watch the LED and the serial monitor at 115200 baud.","es":"Ejecuta el sketch y mira el LED y el monitor serie a 115200 baudios.","fr":"Lancez le sketch et regardez la LED et le moniteur série à 115200 bauds.","hi":"स्केच चलाएँ और LED और 115200 baud पर सीरियल मॉनिटर देखें।","zh":"运行程序，观察 LED，并以 115200 波特查看串口监视器。"},{"de":"Drück EN auf dem Board: Der Sketch startet wieder von vorn.","en":"Press EN on the board: the sketch starts again from the top.","es":"Pulsa EN en la placa: el sketch vuelve a empezar desde arriba.","fr":"Appuyez sur EN sur la carte : le sketch repart du début.","hi":"बोर्ड पर EN दबाएँ: स्केच फिर से ऊपर से शुरू होता है।","zh":"按板上的 EN：程序从头重新开始。"}],"title":{"de":"Eine LED an GPIO23 blinken lassen","en":"Blink an LED on GPIO23","es":"Haz parpadear un LED en GPIO23","fr":"Faire clignoter une LED sur GPIO23","hi":"GPIO23 पर एक LED ब्लिंक करें","zh":"让 GPIO23 上的 LED 闪烁"}},"history":{"baseChain":"2fa003972a1834b5be1d90bdac99615d98e30cbb721aa1ddf34e25aeba41f372","baseRevision":0,"checkpoints":[],"ops":[]},"id":"prj_esp32-devkitc-blink","license":{"spdx":"LicenseRef-iynk-pending"},"meta":{"createdAt":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","description":"The DevKitC has no LED you can program, so the first job is wiring one: GPIO23, a 220 Ω resistor, a red LED and back to GND.","kind":"lesson","locale":"en","tags":["esp32-devkitc","lesson","io"],"title":"Blink an LED on GPIO23","updatedAt":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"},"nets":[{"class":"ground","connections":[{"c":"brd_main","p":"GND"},{"c":"cmp_led1","p":"K"}],"id":"net_gnd","name":"GND"},{"class":"signal","connections":[{"c":"brd_main","p":"GPIO23"},{"c":"cmp_r1","p":"P1"}],"id":"net_gpio23","name":"GPIO23"},{"class":"signal","connections":[{"c":"cmp_led1","p":"A"},{"c":"cmp_r1","p":"P2"}],"id":"net_led1a_r1p2"}],"parameters":[{"id":"par_off","kind":"number","label":{"de":"Aus-Zeit","en":"Off time","es":"Tiempo apagado","fr":"Durée éteinte","hi":"बुझने का समय","zh":"灭灯时长"},"max":2000,"min":50,"name":"off","step":50,"value":500},{"id":"par_on","kind":"number","label":{"de":"An-Zeit","en":"On time","es":"Tiempo encendido","fr":"Durée allumée","hi":"जलने का समय","zh":"亮灯时长"},"max":2000,"min":50,"name":"on","step":50,"value":500}],"provenance":{"contributors":[],"createdBy":"usr_iynk","createdWith":{"app":"iynk","version":"0.1.0"},"origin":{"at":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","catalogue":{"child":"blink","id":"esp32-devkitc","lab":"board"},"kind":"migration","tool":"iynk-catalogue-convert/0.1"},"thirdParty":[{"id":"tp1","kind":"text","review":"unchecked","source":{"title":"Third-party lesson sites named in D-017"},"what":"Lesson order, wording and timings may follow a third-party lesson site (F-197 review pending)"}]},"revision":0,"schemaVersion":"1.1","simulation":{"duration_ms":3000,"faults":[],"runtimes":[{"board":"brd_main","engine":"iynk-interp","id":"rtm_main"}],"seed":625341585,"solver":{"engine":"iynk-mna"},"world":{"inputs":[],"script":[]}},"sources":[{"board":"brd_main","content":"// The DevKitC has no user LED: wire one to GPIO23\nconst int LED_PIN = 23;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  Serial.begin(115200);\n  pinMode(LED_PIN, OUTPUT);\n  Serial.println(\"Blink on GPIO23\");\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  digitalWrite(LED_PIN, HIGH);\n  delay(500);\n  digitalWrite(LED_PIN, LOW);\n  delay(500);\n}\n","id":"src_sketch","language":"arduino-cpp","path":"sketch.ino","role":"firmware"}],"tests":[{"checks":[{"id":"c1","kind":"pin-toggles","label":{"de":"GPIO23 blinkt gleichmäßig","en":"GPIO23 blinks steadily","es":"GPIO23 parpadea con regularidad","fr":"GPIO23 clignote régulièrement","hi":"GPIO23 एक जैसी लय में ब्लिंक करता है","zh":"GPIO23 稳定地闪烁"},"minCycles":2,"periodMs":[100,4000],"pin":"GPIO23","visibility":"visible"},{"byMs":100,"id":"c2","kind":"serial","label":{"de":"Der Sketch gibt seinen Gruß aus","en":"The sketch prints its greeting","es":"El sketch imprime su saludo","fr":"Le sketch affiche son message d'accueil","hi":"स्केच अपना अभिवादन छापता है","zh":"程序打印出它的问候"},"match":"Blink on GPIO23","minCount":1,"regex":false,"visibility":"visible"},{"id":"c3","kind":"code","label":{"de":"Der Pin ist als Ausgang eingerichtet, ohne LED_BUILTIN","en":"The pin is set up as an output, without LED_BUILTIN","es":"El pin se configura como salida, sin LED_BUILTIN","fr":"La broche est configurée en sortie, sans LED_BUILTIN","hi":"पिन आउटपुट के रूप में सेट है, LED_BUILTIN के बिना","zh":"引脚被设为输出，没有用 LED_BUILTIN"},"must":["pinMode","OUTPUT"],"mustNot":["LED_BUILTIN"],"visibility":"visible"}],"id":"main","name":{"de":"Eine LED an GPIO23 blinken lassen","en":"Blink an LED on GPIO23","es":"Haz parpadear un LED en GPIO23","fr":"Faire clignoter une LED sur GPIO23","hi":"GPIO23 पर एक LED ब्लिंक करें","zh":"让 GPIO23 上的 LED 闪烁"},"runMs":3000}],"views":[{"id":"vw_bb","kind":"breadboard","name":"Breadboard","placements":[{"c":"brd_main","x_mm":-90,"y_mm":0},{"c":"cmp_bb","x_mm":0,"y_mm":0},{"c":"cmp_led1","legs":{"A":"c14","K":"c15"},"x_mm":0,"y_mm":0},{"c":"cmp_r1","legs":{"P1":"b10","P2":"b14"},"x_mm":0,"y_mm":0}],"surface":"cmp_bb","wires":[{"color":"orange","from":{"c":"brd_main","kind":"pin","p":"GPIO23"},"id":"wir_1","net":"net_gpio23","to":{"hole":"a10","kind":"hole","surface":"cmp_bb"}},{"color":"black","from":{"c":"brd_main","kind":"pin","p":"GND"},"id":"wir_2","net":"net_gnd","to":{"hole":"a15","kind":"hole","surface":"cmp_bb"}}]}]}
